Problem 3
✏️ Steps / Flow
Set one pointer at the beginning of the list.
Set another pointer at the end of the list.
Swap the values at both pointers.
Move the left pointer forward and the right pointer backward.
Repeat until both pointers meet.
Return the reversed list.

START

Input nums

left = 0
right = length(nums) - 1

WHILE left < right
    Swap nums[left] and nums[right]
    left = left + 1
    right = right - 1
END WHILE

Return nums

STOP
